  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mpadded lspace=\"+1px\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo></mpadded><mn>210</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kcal</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>368</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kcal</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>On subtracting Eq. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> from Eq <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>158</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kcal</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Enthalpy of combustion of one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>unit</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>158</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kcal</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>comb</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>comb</mi></msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>comb</mi></msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>210</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>158</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1632</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kcal</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
